sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Gateway as Envoy Gateway<br/>443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant AuthProxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS (service-ca)
    participant OAuth as OpenShift OAuth Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Backend as Backend Application
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DSCCtrl as DSC Controller
    participant CompCtrl as Component Controller

    Note over User,Backend: Flow 1: Platform Authentication (OAuth)
    User->>Gateway: GET /dashboard<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>AuthProxy: ext_authz check<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS (service-ca)
    AuthProxy-->>Gateway: 302 Redirect to OAuth
    Gateway-->>User: 302 → OAuth login
    User->>OAuth: Login with credentials<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    OAuth-->>User: 302 → /oauth2/callback?code=xxx
    User->>AuthProxy: GET /oauth2/callback?code=xxx<br/>HTTPS/8443
    AuthProxy->>OAuth: Exchange code for token<br/>HTTPS/443, client secret
    OAuth-->>AuthProxy: Access token
    AuthProxy-->>User: Set-Cookie (_oauth2_proxy)
    User->>Gateway: GET /dashboard (with cookie)<br/>HTTPS/443
    Gateway->>AuthProxy: ext_authz check (cookie)
    AuthProxy-->>Gateway: 200 OK + auth headers
    Gateway->>Backend: Forward request<br/>Authorization: Bearer, x-forwarded-access-token

    Note over User,CompCtrl: Flow 2: Component Reconciliation
    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update DataScienceCluster CR<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAPI->>DSCCtrl: Watch event (DSC change)
    DSCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create component CR (e.g., Dashboard)<br/>HTTPS/6443, Controller SA
    K8sAPI->>CompCtrl: Watch event (component CR)
    CompCtrl->>K8sAPI: Apply kustomize manifests<br/>HTTPS/6443, Controller SA
    CompCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update component CR status<br/>HTTPS/6443
    DSCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update DSC status<br/>HTTPS/6443

    Note over User,Route: Flow 3: Dashboard Redirect (Legacy URL)
    User->>Route: GET legacy dashboard URL<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS (edge)
    Route->>Route: Route → dashboard-redirect (nginx)<br/>HTTP/8080
    Route-->>User: 301 Redirect → new gateway hostname
    User->>Gateway: GET new hostname<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, OAuth/OIDC
